OL,3,GNEWSAIsland-wide mental health at work
OL,4,Asurvey launched
OL,5,
OL,6,FA survey asking people to share their
OL,7,Fexperiences about mental health and
OL,8,Fwellbeing in the workplace has
OL,9,Flaunched.
OL,11,FThe Workplace Wellbeing Survey, run by
OL,12,Fcharity Guernsey Mind, aims to reflect
OL,13,Fislander's views on what makes them
OL,14,Ffeel supported at work and what
OL,15,Fchallenges they face.
OL,17,FChallenges noted by the charity include
OL,18,Fpressure, workload and work-life
OL,19,Fbalance.
